---
import Layout from '../../../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const pageTitle = 'Lesson 4: Factorising with HCF — Cambridge Stage 8 Mathematics';
const pageDescription = 'Interactive IFP lesson for factorising algebraic expressions using the highest common factor.';
---

<Layout
	title={pageTitle}
	description={pageDescription}
	titleEn={pageTitle}
	descriptionEn={pageDescription}
	ogTitle={pageTitle}
	ogDescription={pageDescription}
	ogTitleEn={pageTitle}
	ogDescriptionEn={pageDescription}
	currentPage="math"
>
	<main class="factor-page" id="top">
		<section class="deck-shell" data-lesson-root tabindex="-1">
			<header class="deck-topbar">
				<div class="title-block">
					<a class="back-link" href="/e-learning/matematika/matematika_cambridge/matematika_cambridge_stage8/8.2-topic-1">← Back to Topic 1</a>
					<p class="eyebrow">Cambridge Stage 8 · Unit 8.2 Topic 1</p>
					<h1>Lesson 4: Factorising with HCF</h1>
				</div>
				<div class="top-actions">
					<span class="objective-pill">8Ae.04</span>
					<button class="score-pill" type="button" data-total-score>Score 0</button>
					<button class="fullscreen-toggle" type="button" data-fullscreen-toggle aria-pressed="false">⛶ Present Full Screen</button>
				</div>
			</header>

			<div class="progress-area" aria-label="Lesson progress">
				<div class="progress-track"><span data-progress-bar></span></div>
				<span class="progress-label" data-progress-label>Slide 1 of 9</span>
			</div>

			<div class="deck-layout">
				<nav class="slide-map" aria-label="Lesson sections">
					<button type="button" class="slide-dot is-active" data-go-slide="0"><span>1</span>Goal</button>
					<button type="button" class="slide-dot" data-go-slide="1"><span>2</span>Warm-up</button>
					<button type="button" class="slide-dot" data-go-slide="2"><span>3</span>Groups</button>
					<button type="button" class="slide-dot" data-go-slide="3"><span>4</span>HCF</button>
					<button type="button" class="slide-dot" data-go-slide="4"><span>5</span>Steps</button>
					<button type="button" class="slide-dot" data-go-slide="5"><span>6</span>Factory</button>
					<button type="button" class="slide-dot" data-go-slide="6"><span>7</span>Detective</button>
					<button type="button" class="slide-dot" data-go-slide="7"><span>8</span>Race</button>
					<button type="button" class="slide-dot" data-go-slide="8"><span>9</span>Exit</button>
				</nav>

				<section class="slide-stage" aria-live="polite">
					<article class="lesson-slide is-active" data-slide data-slide-title="Learning Goal">
						<div class="slide-label"><span>Slide 1</span><strong>Learning Goal</strong></div>
						<div class="hero-grid">
							<div>
								<p class="mini-kicker">Today’s target</p>
								<h2>Factorising means rewriting an expression using a common factor.</h2>
								<p class="slide-lede">We start with equal groups so students can see why the number outside the bracket is allowed to come out.</p>
								<div class="success-box">
									<h3>By the end, students can:</h3>
									<ul>
										<li>find the highest common factor of two terms</li>
										<li>factorise expressions such as <span class="mathjax" data-tex="6x + 9 = 3(2x + 3)"></span></li>
										<li>check by expanding back to the original expression</li>
									</ul>
								</div>
							</div>
							<div class="badge-card">
								<span>50</span>
								<strong>minutes</strong>
								<p>IFP full-screen lesson with tap games and reveal steps.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</article>

					<article class="lesson-slide" data-slide data-slide-title="Shepherd Warm-up">
						<div class="slide-label"><span>Slide 2</span><strong>Warm-up Puzzle</strong></div>
						<p class="mini-kicker">Story before algebra</p>
						<h2>The shepherd has <strong>3 empty pens</strong>.</h2>
						<p class="slide-lede tight-lede">He has 6 chickens and 9 ducks. Can he make the pens exactly the same?</p>

						<div class="shepherd-puzzle" data-shepherd-game>
							<div class="story-card">
								<div>
									<span class="story-label">Puzzle question</span>
									<h3>Share the animals fairly.</h3>
									<p>Tap an animal. It will jump into the next pen that still needs it. Each pen should end with <strong>2 chickens</strong> and <strong>3 ducks</strong>.</p>
								</div>
								<div class="story-equation">
									<span class="mathjax" data-tex="6 \div 3 = 2"></span>
									<span class="mathjax" data-tex="9 \div 3 = 3"></span>
								</div>
							</div>

							<div class="animal-yard" data-animal-yard aria-label="Animal yard">
								<button type="button" class="animal-tile chicken" data-animal-kind="chicken" data-animal-id="wc1" aria-label="chicken">🐔</button>
								<button type="button" class="animal-tile chicken" data-animal-kind="chicken" data-animal-id="wc2" aria-label="chicken">🐔</button>
								<button type="button" class="animal-tile chicken" data-animal-kind="chicken" data-animal-id="wc3" aria-label="chicken">🐔</button>
								<button type="button" class="animal-tile chicken" data-animal-kind="chicken" data-animal-id="wc4" aria-label="chicken">🐔</button>
								<button type="button" class="animal-tile chicken" data-animal-kind="chicken" data-animal-id="wc5" aria-label="chicken">🐔</button>
								<button type="button" class="animal-tile chicken" data-animal-kind="chicken" data-animal-id="wc6" aria-label="chicken">🐔</button>
								<button type="button" class="animal-tile duck" data-animal-kind="duck" data-animal-id="wd1" aria-label="duck">🦆</button>
								<button type="button" class="animal-tile duck" data-animal-kind="duck" data-animal-id="wd2" aria-label="duck">🦆</button>
								<button type="button" class="animal-tile duck" data-animal-kind="duck" data-animal-id="wd3" aria-label="duck">🦆</button>
								<button type="button" class="animal-tile duck" data-animal-kind="duck" data-animal-id="wd4" aria-label="duck">🦆</button>
								<button type="button" class="animal-tile duck" data-animal-kind="duck" data-animal-id="wd5" aria-label="duck">🦆</button>
								<button type="button" class="animal-tile duck" data-animal-kind="duck" data-animal-id="wd6" aria-label="duck">🦆</button>
								<button type="button" class="animal-tile duck" data-animal-kind="duck" data-animal-id="wd7" aria-label="duck">🦆</button>
								<button type="button" class="animal-tile duck" data-animal-kind="duck" data-animal-id="wd8" aria-label="duck">🦆</button>
								<button type="button" class="animal-tile duck" data-animal-kind="duck" data-animal-id="wd9" aria-label="duck">🦆</button>
							</div>

							<div class="animal-pens">
								<div class="animal-pen" data-animal-pen="1">
									<div class="pen-title"><strong>Pen 1</strong><small data-animal-count>0🐔 + 0🦆</small></div>
									<div class="animal-area"></div>
								</div>
								<div class="animal-pen" data-animal-pen="2">
									<div class="pen-title"><strong>Pen 2</strong><small data-animal-count>0🐔 + 0🦆</small></div>
									<div class="animal-area"></div>
								</div>
								<div class="animal-pen" data-animal-pen="3">
									<div class="pen-title"><strong>Pen 3</strong><small data-animal-count>0🐔 + 0🦆</small></div>
									<div class="animal-area"></div>
								</div>
							</div>

							<div class="warmup-bottom">
								<div class="warmup-status" data-shepherd-status>Tap an animal to start. The aim is 3 identical pens.</div>
								<div class="button-row compact-actions">
									<button type="button" class="primary-button" data-shepherd-auto>Animate demo</button>
									<button type="button" class="secondary-button" data-shepherd-reset>Reset</button>
								</div>
							</div>

							<div class="warmup-link" data-shepherd-result>
								<strong>Story result:</strong> 3 equal pens. Each pen has 2 chickens and 3 ducks. Next, we use the same idea for <span class="mathjax" data-tex="6x + 9"></span>.
							</div>
						</div>
					</article>

					<article class="lesson-slide" data-slide data-slide-title="Equal Groups Hook">
						<div class="slide-label"><span>Slide 3</span><strong>Concept Game</strong></div>
						<p class="mini-kicker">Build equal groups first</p>
						<h2>Build the factorised form of <span class="mathjax" data-tex="6x + 9"></span>.</h2>
						<p class="slide-lede tight-lede">Click the tiles. Each tile will jump into the next group that still needs it. The goal is to make three identical boxes.</p>

						<div class="equal-group-builder" data-grouping-game>
							<div class="egb-top-row">
								<div class="source-panel">
									<div class="panel-heading">
										<span>Tile Bank</span>
										<strong><span class="mathjax" data-tex="6x + 9"></span></strong>
									</div>
									<p class="bank-note">There are <strong>6 x-tiles</strong> and <strong>9 unit tiles</strong>.</p>
									<div class="tile-bank" data-tile-bank aria-label="Tile bank">
										<button type="button" class="tile tile-x" data-kind="x" data-tile-id="x1">x</button>
										<button type="button" class="tile tile-x" data-kind="x" data-tile-id="x2">x</button>
										<button type="button" class="tile tile-x" data-kind="x" data-tile-id="x3">x</button>
										<button type="button" class="tile tile-x" data-kind="x" data-tile-id="x4">x</button>
										<button type="button" class="tile tile-x" data-kind="x" data-tile-id="x5">x</button>
										<button type="button" class="tile tile-x" data-kind="x" data-tile-id="x6">x</button>
										<button type="button" class="tile tile-one" data-kind="one" data-tile-id="u1">1</button>
										<button type="button" class="tile tile-one" data-kind="one" data-tile-id="u2">1</button>
										<button type="button" class="tile tile-one" data-kind="one" data-tile-id="u3">1</button>
										<button type="button" class="tile tile-one" data-kind="one" data-tile-id="u4">1</button>
										<button type="button" class="tile tile-one" data-kind="one" data-tile-id="u5">1</button>
										<button type="button" class="tile tile-one" data-kind="one" data-tile-id="u6">1</button>
										<button type="button" class="tile tile-one" data-kind="one" data-tile-id="u7">1</button>
										<button type="button" class="tile tile-one" data-kind="one" data-tile-id="u8">1</button>
										<button type="button" class="tile tile-one" data-kind="one" data-tile-id="u9">1</button>
									</div>
								</div>

								<div class="why-panel">
									<span class="why-tag">Why does 3 go outside?</span>
									<p>Both terms can be shared into <strong>3 equal groups</strong>.</p>
									<div class="mini-equations">
										<span class="mathjax" data-tex="6x \div 3 = 2x"></span>
										<span class="mathjax" data-tex="9 \div 3 = 3"></span>
									</div>
									<p><strong>Outside</strong> = number of equal groups. <strong>Inside</strong> = one group.</p>
									<div class="factor-result" data-group-answer aria-live="polite">
										<span>Result area</span>
										<p class="result-placeholder" data-result-placeholder>Complete the three groups first. The final form will appear here.</p>
										<div class="result-content" data-result-content>
											<strong><span class="mathjax" data-tex="6x + 9 = 3(2x + 3)"></span></strong>
											<p><strong>3</strong> goes outside because there are <strong>3 identical groups</strong>. <span class="mathjax" data-tex="2x + 3"></span> goes inside because it is the content of <strong>one group</strong>.</p>
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							<div class="group-zones" aria-label="Equal group boxes">
								<div class="group-zone" data-group-drop="1">
									<div class="group-title"><strong>Group 1</strong><small data-count>0x + 0</small></div>
									<div class="tile-area" aria-label="Group 1 tile area"></div>
								</div>
								<div class="group-zone" data-group-drop="2">
									<div class="group-title"><strong>Group 2</strong><small data-count>0x + 0</small></div>
									<div class="tile-area" aria-label="Group 2 tile area"></div>
								</div>
								<div class="group-zone" data-group-drop="3">
									<div class="group-title"><strong>Group 3</strong><small data-count>0x + 0</small></div>
									<div class="tile-area" aria-label="Group 3 tile area"></div>
								</div>
							</div>

							<div class="egb-bottom-row">
								<div class="status-card" data-group-status>Click an x-tile or a unit tile to start filling the equal groups.</div>
								<div class="button-row compact-actions">
									<button type="button" class="primary-button" data-auto-groups>Auto demo</button>
									<button type="button" class="secondary-button" data-check-groups>Check</button>
									<button type="button" class="secondary-button" data-reset-groups>Reset</button>
								</div>
							</div>

						</div>
					</article>


					<article class="lesson-slide" data-slide data-slide-title="HCF Hunter">
						<div class="slide-label"><span>Slide 4</span><strong>Game 1</strong></div>
						<p class="mini-kicker">Find the outside factor</p>
						<h2>HCF Hunter</h2>
						<div class="choice-game" data-choice-game="hcf">
							<div class="game-header"><div><span class="round-label" data-round>Round 1 / 5</span><h3>Which factor should go outside the bracket?</h3></div><div class="local-score"><span>Score</span><strong data-score>0</strong></div></div>
							<div class="big-expression"><span class="mathjax" data-prompt data-tex="8x + 12"></span></div>
							<div class="option-grid" data-options></div>
							<p class="feedback-line" data-feedback>Choose the greatest factor shared by both terms.</p>
							<div class="button-row"><button type="button" class="secondary-button" data-next-round>Next round</button><button type="button" class="secondary-button" data-reset-game>Reset game</button></div>
						</div>
					</article>

					<article class="lesson-slide" data-slide data-slide-title="Factorising Steps">
						<div class="slide-label"><span>Slide 5</span><strong>Method</strong></div>
						<p class="mini-kicker">Reveal one step at a time</p>
						<h2>Factorise <span class="mathjax" data-tex="12x + 18"></span>.</h2>
						<div class="step-reveal" data-step-reveal>
							<div class="step-card is-visible" data-step="0"><strong>Step 1</strong><p>Find the HCF of <span class="mathjax" data-tex="12"></span> and <span class="mathjax" data-tex="18"></span>.</p></div>
							<div class="step-card" data-step="1"><strong>Step 2</strong><p>The HCF is <span class="mathjax" data-tex="6"></span>. This goes outside the bracket.</p></div>
							<div class="step-card" data-step="2"><strong>Step 3</strong><p>Divide each term: <span class="mathjax" data-tex="12x \div 6 = 2x"></span> and <span class="mathjax" data-tex="18 \div 6 = 3"></span>.</p></div>
							<div class="step-card" data-step="3"><strong>Step 4</strong><p>Write the factorised form: <span class="mathjax" data-tex="12x + 18 = 6(2x + 3)"></span>.</p></div>
							<div class="step-card" data-step="4"><strong>Check</strong><p>Expand it back: <span class="mathjax" data-tex="6(2x + 3) = 12x + 18"></span>.</p></div>
							<div class="button-row"><button type="button" class="primary-button" data-next-step>Next step</button><button type="button" class="secondary-button" data-reset-steps>Reset steps</button></div>
						</div>
					</article>

					<article class="lesson-slide" data-slide data-slide-title="Factor Factory">
						<div class="slide-label"><span>Slide 6</span><strong>Game 2</strong></div>
						<p class="mini-kicker">Choose the finished product</p>
						<h2>Factor Factory</h2>
						<div class="choice-game" data-choice-game="factory">
							<div class="game-header"><div><span class="round-label" data-round>Job 1 / 5</span><h3>Choose the fully factorised form.</h3></div><div class="local-score"><span>Score</span><strong data-score>0</strong></div></div>
							<div class="factory-row"><div class="conveyor"><span class="mathjax" data-prompt data-tex="10x + 15"></span></div><div class="machine">FACTOR<br />FACTORY</div></div>
							<div class="option-grid" data-options></div>
							<p class="feedback-line" data-feedback>Use the HCF, then divide every term.</p>
							<div class="button-row"><button type="button" class="secondary-button" data-next-round>Next job</button><button type="button" class="secondary-button" data-reset-game>Reset factory</button></div>
						</div>
					</article>

					<article class="lesson-slide" data-slide data-slide-title="Error Detective">
						<div class="slide-label"><span>Slide 7</span><strong>Game 3</strong></div>
						<p class="mini-kicker">Misconception check</p>
						<h2>Error Detective</h2>
						<div class="choice-game" data-choice-game="detective">
							<div class="game-header"><div><span class="round-label" data-round>Mistake 1 / 3</span><h3>What went wrong?</h3></div><div class="local-score"><span>Score</span><strong data-score>0</strong></div></div>
							<div class="student-work"><span>Student work</span><p><span class="mathjax" data-prompt data-tex="8x + 12 = 2(4x + 10)"></span></p></div>
							<div class="option-grid text-options" data-options></div>
							<p class="feedback-line" data-feedback>Choose the best explanation.</p>
							<div class="button-row"><button type="button" class="secondary-button" data-next-round>Next mistake</button><button type="button" class="secondary-button" data-reset-game>Reset detective</button></div>
						</div>
					</article>

					<article class="lesson-slide" data-slide data-slide-title="Board Race">
						<div class="slide-label"><span>Slide 8</span><strong>Board Race</strong></div>
						<p class="mini-kicker">Classroom competition</p>
						<h2>Team factorising race</h2>
						<div class="race-game" data-race-game>
							<div class="race-toolbar">
								<div class="race-meta-card">
									<span>Round</span>
									<strong><span data-race-round>1</span>/10</strong>
								</div>
								<div class="race-meta-card timer-mini">
									<span>Timer</span>
									<strong><span data-race-time>60</span>s</strong>
								</div>
								<div class="race-actions">
									<button type="button" class="primary-button" data-race-start>Start timer</button>
									<button type="button" class="secondary-button" data-race-next>Next round</button>
									<button type="button" class="secondary-button" data-race-reset>Reset game</button>
								</div>
							</div>

							<div class="race-team-grid" aria-label="Team questions and scores">
								<div class="race-team-card" data-team-card="A"><div class="team-head"><strong>Team A</strong><span>Score <b data-team-score>0</b></span></div><div class="team-expression"><span class="mathjax" data-race-expression data-tex=""></span></div><p class="team-answer" data-race-answer hidden></p><div class="team-actions"><button type="button" data-reveal-answer>Reveal</button><button type="button" data-add-score>+ Score</button></div></div>
								<div class="race-team-card" data-team-card="B"><div class="team-head"><strong>Team B</strong><span>Score <b data-team-score>0</b></span></div><div class="team-expression"><span class="mathjax" data-race-expression data-tex=""></span></div><p class="team-answer" data-race-answer hidden></p><div class="team-actions"><button type="button" data-reveal-answer>Reveal</button><button type="button" data-add-score>+ Score</button></div></div>
								<div class="race-team-card" data-team-card="C"><div class="team-head"><strong>Team C</strong><span>Score <b data-team-score>0</b></span></div><div class="team-expression"><span class="mathjax" data-race-expression data-tex=""></span></div><p class="team-answer" data-race-answer hidden></p><div class="team-actions"><button type="button" data-reveal-answer>Reveal</button><button type="button" data-add-score>+ Score</button></div></div>
								<div class="race-team-card" data-team-card="D"><div class="team-head"><strong>Team D</strong><span>Score <b data-team-score>0</b></span></div><div class="team-expression"><span class="mathjax" data-race-expression data-tex=""></span></div><p class="team-answer" data-race-answer hidden></p><div class="team-actions"><button type="button" data-reveal-answer>Reveal</button><button type="button" data-add-score>+ Score</button></div></div>
								<div class="race-team-card" data-team-card="E"><div class="team-head"><strong>Team E</strong><span>Score <b data-team-score>0</b></span></div><div class="team-expression"><span class="mathjax" data-race-expression data-tex=""></span></div><p class="team-answer" data-race-answer hidden></p><div class="team-actions"><button type="button" data-reveal-answer>Reveal</button><button type="button" data-add-score>+ Score</button></div></div>
								<div class="race-team-card" data-team-card="F"><div class="team-head"><strong>Team F</strong><span>Score <b data-team-score>0</b></span></div><div class="team-expression"><span class="mathjax" data-race-expression data-tex=""></span></div><p class="team-answer" data-race-answer hidden></p><div class="team-actions"><button type="button" data-reveal-answer>Reveal</button><button type="button" data-add-score>+ Score</button></div></div>
							</div>

							<div class="race-status" data-race-status>Press Start timer. Teams factorise their own expression. Teacher checks and taps + Score for correct answers.</div>
						</div>
					</article>

					<article class="lesson-slide" data-slide data-slide-title="Exit Ticket">
						<div class="slide-label"><span>Slide 9</span><strong>Exit Ticket</strong></div>
						<p class="mini-kicker">Final check</p>
						<h2>Exit ticket</h2>
						<div class="exit-grid">
							<div><strong>1</strong><p>Factorise <span class="mathjax" data-tex="8x + 20"></span>.</p></div>
							<div><strong>2</strong><p>What is the HCF of <span class="mathjax" data-tex="12a"></span> and <span class="mathjax" data-tex="18"></span>?</p></div>
							<div><strong>3</strong><p>How can you check if your factorised answer is correct?</p></div>
						</div>
						<button type="button" class="primary-button" data-toggle-target="exit-answers">Show sample answers</button>
						<div id="exit-answers" class="sample-answer hidden-answer">
							<p><strong>1.</strong> <span class="mathjax" data-tex="8x + 20 = 4(2x + 5)"></span></p>
							<p><strong>2.</strong> The HCF is <span class="mathjax" data-tex="6"></span>.</p>
							<p><strong>3.</strong> Expand the bracket and check that it returns the original expression.</p>
						</div>
					</article>
				</section>
			</div>

			<footer class="deck-controls">
				<button type="button" class="secondary-button" data-prev-slide>Back</button>
				<button type="button" class="teacher-button" data-teacher-notes-toggle>Teacher Notes</button>
				<button type="button" class="secondary-button" data-reset-slide>Reset Slide</button>
				<button type="button" class="primary-button" data-next-slide>Next</button>
			</footer>

			<aside class="teacher-notes" data-teacher-notes hidden>
				<div class="teacher-notes-card">
					<div class="teacher-notes-head"><strong>Teacher Notes</strong><button type="button" data-teacher-notes-close aria-label="Close teacher notes">×</button></div>
					<p data-teacher-notes-text>Use this slide to set the goal clearly.</p>
				</div>
			</aside>
		</section>
